 "title": "Semantic Progress Function (SPF) for Smooth AI Video",
 "summary": "A research framework that maps video semantic trajectories to a 1D scalar function to ensure smooth temporal pacing. It enables temporal linearization and fixes uneven speeds or stalls common in generative video models.",
